    "notes": "NVIDIA DGX Spark (ASUS Ascent GX10, GB10) on Ubuntu 24.04 / DGX OS, driver 580.173.02, CUDA 13.0. SparkInfer stack at commit 960652b of https://github.com/0xBakeer/DeepSeek-v4-Flash-One-DGX-Spark (branch atlas-run-20260824), a fork of MiaAI-Lab/DeepSeek-v4-Flash-One-DGX-Spark; compose.yml pins the image ghcr.io/0xsero/deepseek-v4-flash-0731-spark-sparkinfer@sha256:2e077489a83a0360952828051fe7f7a32c1801e5ce8436d85f7267583d614ff4 by digest and bind-mounts twelve patch files over it, so image plus commit together define the stack. Model revision 22f28d32b9b29b4352eaa380ff8c2c170b2847ab. This configuration differs from the upstream repository defaults in five places, all carried explicitly in args: max-model-len 262144 (upstream 384000), max-num-seqs 4 (upstream 1), gpu-memory-utilization 0.95 (upstream 0.94), long-prefill-token-threshold 0 (upstream 1024), and ablate true (upstream false). Thinking is ON and effort is max, both engine defaults. eval-vision-v1 was not run: this model is text-only, so a vision score would be an absence of the modality rather than a measurement of it. The machine is otherwise idle."
